"/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids came in under 90% of normal in September to October in 38 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 168% of normal in May to June, then fell to 38% in August to September and 38% again in November to December. So far in 2026, the middle sat at 68% of normal in March to April and 98% in June to July.</p>"}
